Momentum 4 Controls is an original GJS implementation.

Backend: momentumctl, MIT licensed, https://codeberg.org/galen/momentumctl
The extension only runs the installed momentumctl executable. No Rust source
is included.

Behaviour reference: omarchy-momentumctl, Apache-2.0 licensed,
https://github.com/timmo001/omarchy-momentumctl
No QML source, icons or other assets were copied.

The isolated Shell test harness follows the launch procedure of GNOME Shell's
gnome-shell-test-tool. Its implementation is original.

